# Syncing with Backend

`src/services/admin.ts` mirrors `sub2api/backend/internal/api/admin/*.go`.

When backend adds a new admin endpoint:

1. Add types to `src/types/admin.ts`
2. Add service function to `src/services/admin.ts`
3. Wire up in UI (`app/...`)

Use existing `adminFetch` patterns — never bypass envelope parsing or switch to Bearer auth.
